addGrid (name class props);grid;div
⍝ Create a Grid on behalf of one of the Tabs

grid←name,'.GRID'
grid eWC props,(⊂'Event' 'CellMove' 'CBCellMove' class)
(div←grid,'.DIV') eWC 'Div'                                 ⍝ a Div as an Input allows us to display HTML
grid eWS ('Input' div)('CellTypes' (1⍨¨grid eWG 'Values'))  ⍝ Set all CellTypes to point to the Div

eNQ grid 'CellMove' 1 1              ⍝ Move to top left cell
class CBCellMove grid 'CellMove' 1 1 ⍝ /// Execute CellMove callback directly: eNQ not currently working
